 robot. Activated 3 months later, you arrive 6 full months after the incident occurred, with Axiox still completely in the dark about what happened on Kepler 186F. In Kepler 186F, survival is just the beginning\u2014you must investigate. Your choices shape the story, unfolding a thrilling adventure from the planet's dark side to its space station.", "summary": "In Kepler 186F, survival is just the beginning\u2014you must investigate. Your choices shape the story, unfolding a thrilling adventure from the planet's dark side to its space station.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/kepler-186f", "videos": [{"id": 174921, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "_U4cluFIwCA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_U4cluFIwCA", "title": "Kepler 186F - Teaser", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_U4cluFIwCA/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 185078, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "7MEpUnhIMCM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7MEpUnhIMCM", "title": "Planet Kepler 186F - Exclusive Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7MEpUnhIMCM/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}